    "blurb": "A monumental fan of green laser strings cuts through volumetric smoke, flaring and sending pulse rings skyward whenever someone plucks their beam.",
    "prompt": "A laser harp: a fan of vertical green beams through haze, one beam for each person in the room; anyone can pluck their beam, which flares, vibrates and sends a ring of light up the column. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
